%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor': '#4285f4', 'secondaryColor': '#34a853'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as 👤 User
    participant Browser as 🌐 Browser
    participant GTM as 📦 GTM Container
    participant DL as 📊 dataLayer
    participant Tag1 as 🏷️ [TAG_NAME_1]
    participant Tag2 as 🏷️ [TAG_NAME_2]
    participant Server as ☁️ Server-Side

    User->>Browser: [USER_ACTION]
    Browser->>DL: dataLayer.push({event: '[EVENT_NAME]'})
    DL->>GTM: Event Received
    GTM->>GTM: Evaluate Triggers
    
    alt Tag Fires Successfully
        GTM->>Tag1: ✅ Fire Tag
        GTM->>Tag2: ✅ Fire Tag
    else Tag Blocked
        GTM--xTag1: ❌ Consent Denied
    end
    
    opt Server-Side Enabled
        GTM->>Server: Forward Event
        Server->>Server: Enrich Data
    end
